BEFORE any flowables or chrome. Both templates use `onPageEnd=draw_footer` for the unified footer.
No page header exists — it was removed in v20. Body frame top margin is 45pt (just page edge
padding, no header space needed).
MUST use doc.multiBuild(story) instead of doc.build(story) for TOC page numbers to resolve
