**The TOC uses ReportLab's built-in TableOfContents flowable. Page numbers are
automatically resolved via multiBuild (two-pass). Headings are auto-detected
by MyDocTemplate.afterFlowable() — no manual TOC item registration needed.
Just add headings as normal Paragraphs with styles h1/h2/h3 and they appear in the TOC.**

**v20: rightColumnWidth=40 gives page numbers a dedicated 40pt column so the
dot leader never overlaps or crowds the page number text.**

